flowchart TD
    U[User Intent] --> H[MCP Host / LLM]
    H --> R[Read Tools]
    H --> P[Plan Tools]
    R --> DPClient[DevPanelClient]
    DPClient --> DP[DevPanel API]
    P --> PS[PlanService]
    PS --> DPClient
    PS --> Store[(PlanStore)]
    H --> E[devpanel_approve_and_execute_plan]
    E --> AS[ApprovalService]
    AS -->|Form Elicitation| FE[Native Client Dialog]
    AS -->|URL Elicitation| UE[Client Opens URL]
    AS -->|External URL| EU[HTTP Review Server]
    FE -->|Human Approves| Store
    UE -->|Human Approves| Store
    EU -->|Human Approves| Store
    E --> ES[ExecutionService]
    ES --> Store
    ES -->|Revalidate| DPClient
    ES -->|Only if approved + unchanged| DPClient
    DPClient --> DP
    ES --> Store
